      "title": "CHAMBLFERT: Steady Earnings Assumptions And Upcoming Results Meeting Will Support Upside",
      "body": "Analysts have kept their fair value estimate for Chambal Fertilisers and Chemicals steady at ₹559.50 per share, citing unchanged assumptions around revenue growth, profit margins and future P/E, even though discount rate inputs have been marginally refreshed. Analyst Commentary Bullish Takeaways Bullish analysts view the unchanged fair value estimate of ₹559.50 per share as consistent with their thesis that Chambal Fertilisers and Chemicals has a reasonably clear earnings profile under the current set of revenue and margin assumptions.",
